1
00:00:30,449 --> 00:00:31,508
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's not in here.</font>

2
00:00:38,441 --> 00:00:39,999
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's not in here, either!</font>

3
00:00:47,062 --> 00:00:48,191
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's not in here, either!</font>

4
00:00:55,184 --> 00:00:57,651
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where the heck... are you?</font>

5
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:01,647
<font color="#FFFFFF">We've finally... made it this far!</font>

6
00:01:03,316 --> 00:01:04,415
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where are you...?</font>

7
00:01:05,643 --> 00:01:06,872
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where are you?</font>

8
00:01:08,471 --> 00:01:10,209
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke!</font>

9
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:40,938
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura, huh?</font>

10
00:01:53,266 --> 00:01:55,963
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sa... su... ke.</font>

11
00:02:32,686 --> 00:02:33,855
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke...</font>

12
00:02:35,883 --> 00:02:37,122
<font color="#FFFFFF">So it's you, Naruto...?</font>

13
00:02:42,616 --> 00:02:45,044
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't even have
parents or siblings...</font>

14
00:02:45,873 --> 00:02:48,041
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you know about me?</font>

15
00:02:48,570 --> 00:02:50,938
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've been alone from the start!</font>

16
00:02:51,268 --> 00:02:53,905
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you know about me? Huh?</font>

17
00:02:56,802 --> 00:02:59,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's having the bond that
makes it painful!</font>

18
00:02:59,959 --> 00:03:05,254
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've no idea
what it's like to lose that...!</font>

19
00:03:06,093 --> 00:03:07,152
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're right.</font>

20
00:03:07,451 --> 00:03:11,647
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know about having
real parents or siblings...</font>

21
00:03:13,585 --> 00:03:14,814
<font color="#FFFFFF">If that's the case...</font>

22
00:03:15,743 --> 00:03:17,312
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why Naruto...?</font>

23
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:21,178
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why do you go so far for me...?</font>

24
00:03:23,076 --> 00:03:26,432
<font color="#FFFFFF">To me, it's a bond...
I've finally been able to establish.</font>

25
00:03:27,601 --> 00:03:31,368
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why I'll stop you!</font>

26
00:03:32,796 --> 00:03:36,193
<font color="#FFFFFF">If that's the case,
then why didn't you...?</font>

27
00:03:38,790 --> 00:03:42,057
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then I'll just break that bond!</font>

28
00:03:43,186 --> 00:03:45,154
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why didn't you kill me
back then?</font>

29
00:03:45,683 --> 00:03:47,911
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is that how you wanted
to break the bond?</font>

30
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:50,049
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke!</font>

31
00:03:52,347 --> 00:03:53,745
<font color="#FFFFFF">The reason's simple...</font>

32
00:03:55,943 --> 00:03:59,340
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not that I couldn't break
the bond with you...</font>

33
00:04:00,169 --> 00:04:02,736
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're one who might be able</font>

34
00:04:02,766 --> 00:04:05,164
<font color="#FFFFFF">to use the same Mangekyo
Sharingan as mine...</font>

35
00:04:07,661 --> 00:04:10,558
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, there is one condition...</font>

36
00:04:14,454 --> 00:04:16,482
<font color="#FFFFFF">You must kill...</font>

37
00:04:17,981 --> 00:04:19,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">your closest friend.</font>

38
00:04:20,019 --> 00:04:21,677
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was just irritating to me.</font>

39
00:04:21,717 --> 00:04:25,613
<font color="#FFFFFF">Obtaining power according to
the method I heard about from him.</font>

40
00:04:27,411 --> 00:04:32,337
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're only alive because
of my passing whim.</font>

41
00:04:49,150 --> 00:04:50,319
<font color="#FFFFFF">When did he...?</font>

42
00:04:51,048 --> 00:04:52,546
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come to think of it,</font>

43
00:04:52,586 --> 00:04:55,913
<font color="#FFFFFF">didn't you have a dream
of becoming the Hokage...?</font>

44
00:04:57,511 --> 00:04:59,609
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you had the time to
chase after me,</font>

45
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:02,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">you should've spent that
time training or something...</font>

46
00:05:03,106 --> 00:05:04,704
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right... Naruto?</font>

47
00:05:06,872 --> 00:05:08,670
<font color="#FFFFFF">And that's why this time around...</font>

48
00:05:08,770 --> 00:05:10,568
<font color="#FFFFFF">You'll lose your life...</font>

49
00:05:13,465 --> 00:05:16,093
<font color="#FFFFFF">because of my passing whim.</font>

50
00:05:24,215 --> 00:05:26,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's no way a guy
who can't even save one friend...</font>

51
00:05:26,852 --> 00:05:28,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">can ever become the Hokage.</font>

52
00:05:31,148 --> 00:05:33,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">Isn't that right... Sasuke?</font>

53
00:05:41,038 --> 00:05:42,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke...!</font>

54
00:05:57,881 --> 00:05:59,579
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

55
00:06:03,415 --> 00:06:10,368
<font color="#FFFFFF">Show him... our... powers.</font>

56
00:06:15,733 --> 00:06:17,132
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's the matter...?</font>

57
00:06:28,450 --> 00:06:30,818
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why do you hesitate...?</font>

58
00:06:33,945 --> 00:06:37,541
<font color="#FFFFFF">You need my power, don't you?</font>

59
00:06:43,875 --> 00:06:45,673
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then...</font>

60
00:06:49,429 --> 00:06:51,967
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who do you want to kill...?</font>

61
00:06:54,894 --> 00:06:57,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">You should know.</font>

62
00:06:58,161 --> 00:07:01,587
<font color="#FFFFFF">That you can't do anything
on your own.</font>

63
00:07:03,385 --> 00:07:05,913
<font color="#FFFFFF">SEAL
Break the seal completely!</font>

64
00:07:06,252 --> 00:07:10,948
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll grant you all of my powers
if you do.</font>

65
00:07:20,468 --> 00:07:21,597
<font color="#FFFFFF">How...?</font>

66
00:07:23,295 --> 00:07:24,894
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can see it now...</font>

67
00:07:25,833 --> 00:07:28,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">So this is your unknown power, huh...?</font>

68
00:07:29,689 --> 00:07:31,128
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who would've thought...</font>

69
00:07:31,158 --> 00:07:34,384
<font color="#FFFFFF">you'd have something like this
inside of you...</font>

70
00:07:35,423 --> 00:07:38,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see...
So you're an Uchiha...</font>

71
00:07:39,050 --> 00:07:42,047
<font color="#FFFFFF">My how you've grown...</font>

72
00:07:43,016 --> 00:07:47,241
<font color="#FFFFFF">To think you'd be able
to see me within Naruto...</font>

73
00:07:48,170 --> 00:07:50,568
<font color="#FFFFFF">That loathsome Sharingan...</font>

74
00:07:50,768 --> 00:07:54,704
<font color="#FFFFFF">So that's the power of
the cursed clan, huh?</font>

75
00:07:57,161 --> 00:08:01,427
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems this isn't the first time
you've seen the Sharingan.</font>

76
00:08:02,726 --> 00:08:06,592
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then... you must be
the Nine-Tailed Fox, huh...?</font>

77
00:08:09,749 --> 00:08:14,314
<font color="#FFFFFF">That vision, and Chakra
more ominous than mine...</font>

78
00:08:15,014 --> 00:08:19,010
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's just like...
Madara Uchiha, from long ago...</font>

79
00:08:26,702 --> 00:08:29,829
<font color="#FFFFFF">Heck if I know... that person.</font>

80
00:10:06,672 --> 00:10:07,931
<font color="#FFFFFF">Homecoming
Did you find it?</font>

81
00:10:08,830 --> 00:10:10,568
<font color="#FFFFFF">All clear here.</font>

82
00:10:11,297 --> 00:10:12,666
<font color="#FFFFFF">Target acquired!</font>

83
00:10:22,286 --> 00:10:24,984
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh-oh! It'll get into the village!</font>

84
00:10:25,583 --> 00:10:27,351
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way will we let it get away!</font>

85
00:10:39,899 --> 00:10:41,067
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the—?</font>

86
00:10:41,797 --> 00:10:43,035
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where'd it go?</font>

87
00:10:43,335 --> 00:10:44,234
<font color="#FFFFFF">That way!</font>

88
00:10:45,663 --> 00:10:47,091
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, you squirts!</font>

89
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,028
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey!</font>

90
00:10:50,428 --> 00:10:51,627
<font color="#FFFFFF">W-We're sorry!</font>

91
00:10:51,927 --> 00:10:53,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you doing?</font>

92
00:10:53,585 --> 00:10:54,654
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry!</font>

93
00:10:57,781 --> 00:10:58,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry about that.</font>

94
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:01,147
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ichiraku Ramen</font>

95
00:11:01,177 --> 00:11:02,746
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going out for a small delivery.</font>

96
00:11:04,174 --> 00:11:05,613
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa! Outta the way!</font>

97
00:11:12,066 --> 00:11:13,235
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry, pops!</font>

98
00:11:13,435 --> 00:11:15,233
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, Naruto!</font>

99
00:11:17,531 --> 00:11:19,199
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I mean...</font>

100
00:11:19,599 --> 00:11:21,427
<font color="#FFFFFF">Konohamaru!</font>

101
00:11:33,345 --> 00:11:35,913
<font color="#FFFFFF">Konohamaru!
We've cornered the target.</font>

102
00:11:37,911 --> 00:11:38,939
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hurry up.</font>

103
00:11:39,609 --> 00:11:41,177
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll get away!</font>

104
00:11:42,576 --> 00:11:43,475
<font color="#FFFFFF">No problem!</font>

105
00:11:49,029 --> 00:11:50,498
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why you—!</font>

106
00:11:50,528 --> 00:11:52,066
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Give it up already!
- Konohamaru!</font>

107
00:11:56,392 --> 00:11:58,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got him!</font>

108
00:11:59,319 --> 00:12:02,586
<font color="#FFFFFF">A ribbon on the right ear...
No doubt about it.</font>

109
00:12:02,886 --> 00:12:06,951
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ebisu Sensei, we captured
the lost pet target "Dora."</font>

110
00:12:07,151 --> 00:12:09,679
<font color="#FFFFFF">Heh-heh... Mission complete!</font>

111
00:12:17,171 --> 00:12:19,839
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my adorable Dora!</font>

112
00:12:20,538 --> 00:12:24,164
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was worried to death about you.
Where were you?</font>

113
00:12:24,794 --> 00:12:26,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd want to run away too,</font>

114
00:12:26,792 --> 00:12:28,760
<font color="#FFFFFF">if an old lady like that
were my owner...</font>

115
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:30,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Konohamaru!</font>

116
00:12:32,126 --> 00:12:34,184
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, here is the reward.</font>

117
00:12:35,253 --> 00:12:37,321
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then, let's go home, Dora.</font>

118
00:12:42,776 --> 00:12:46,312
<font color="#FFFFFF">How many hours did it take
you guys to catch a simple lost cat?</font>

119
00:12:46,772 --> 00:12:50,408
<font color="#FFFFFF">But that cat was incredibly quick...</font>

120
00:12:50,568 --> 00:12:52,266
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he seemed accustomed
to running away...</font>

121
00:12:52,306 --> 00:12:53,705
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't want to hear
any excuses!</font>

122
00:12:53,835 --> 00:12:59,029
<font color="#FFFFFF">A mission like this must be carried out
more quickly and properly!</font>

123
00:12:59,229 --> 00:13:00,728
<font color="#FFFFFF">You guys are not good enough!</font>

124
00:13:00,897 --> 00:13:05,123
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't display my true strength
on a lame mission like this!</font>

125
00:13:05,952 --> 00:13:07,621
<font color="#FFFFFF">Say, Iruka Sensei.</font>

126
00:13:07,651 --> 00:13:09,649
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't you have more of
an awesome mission for me?</font>

127
00:13:10,118 --> 00:13:12,116
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen... Konohamaru...</font>

128
00:13:12,146 --> 00:13:16,382
<font color="#FFFFFF">Konohamaru, you guys just
became Genin.</font>

129
00:13:16,412 --> 00:13:19,609
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's no way I can give missions
like that to you right off the bat, right?</font>

130
00:13:19,908 --> 00:13:22,006
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll be D-rank missions
until further notice.</font>

131
00:13:22,406 --> 00:13:24,674
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't be satisfied with that!</font>

132
00:13:24,903 --> 00:13:26,132
<font color="#FFFFFF">After all, in the future</font>

133
00:13:26,172 --> 00:13:27,631
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to become
the Seventh Hokage.</font>

134
00:13:28,170 --> 00:13:30,927
<font color="#FFFFFF">Seventh? Not the Sixth?</font>

135
00:13:31,397 --> 00:13:34,024
<font color="#FFFFFF">Brother Naruto's going to be the Sixth.</font>

136
00:13:43,155 --> 00:13:45,153
<font color="#FFFFFF">Brother Naruto, huh...?</font>

137
00:13:45,753 --> 00:13:47,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">I wonder where he is right now...</font>

138
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:52,046
<font color="#FFFFFF">I bet he'll return having become
an awesome Shinobi.</font>

139
00:13:52,706 --> 00:13:54,644
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have faith in him!</font>

140
00:13:58,839 --> 00:14:03,035
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's more of a Second Naruto
than a Seventh Hokage...</font>

141
00:14:04,764 --> 00:14:07,591
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto... Are you holding up okay?</font>

142
00:14:08,889 --> 00:14:13,685
<font color="#FFFFFF">No matter what, I'll get strong
and bring Sasuke back!</font>

143
00:14:15,583 --> 00:14:18,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Quite a bit of time has passed
since he said that</font>

144
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:21,047
<font color="#FFFFFF">and went off for real training
with Master Jiraiya...</font>

145
00:14:21,377 --> 00:14:25,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes. Isn't it just about the time
he should be returning?</font>

146
00:14:27,211 --> 00:14:29,309
<font color="#FFFFFF">We need him to return.</font>

147
00:14:31,507 --> 00:14:33,864
<font color="#FFFFFF">After all, there will probably be
significant developments sometime soon.</font>

148
00:14:55,143 --> 00:14:57,810
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey... Could that be...?</font>

149
00:14:58,210 --> 00:15:00,208
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah... No doubt about it.</font>

150
00:15:03,874 --> 00:15:05,173
<font color="#FFFFFF">Miss Sakura!</font>

151
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:09,768
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Konohamaru!</font>

152
00:15:09,828 --> 00:15:11,267
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where are you off to?</font>

153
00:15:11,627 --> 00:15:13,125
<font color="#FFFFFF">The main village gate.</font>

154
00:15:13,265 --> 00:15:17,321
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have to pick up the morning pedestrian
traffic ledger for Lady Tsunade.</font>

155
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:18,919
<font color="#FFFFFF">You want to come?</font>

156
00:15:20,088 --> 00:15:22,156
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been about two and a half years.</font>

157
00:15:22,516 --> 00:15:24,384
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, it has...</font>

158
00:15:26,082 --> 00:15:29,479
<font color="#FFFFFF">And then that Dora cat suddenly
starts scratching me like crazy!</font>

159
00:15:30,508 --> 00:15:33,844
<font color="#FFFFFF">We had missions like that, too.
It kind of takes me back.</font>

160
00:15:34,374 --> 00:15:35,373
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come to think of it,</font>

161
00:15:35,403 --> 00:15:37,900
<font color="#FFFFFF">have you heard anything
from Brother Naruto?</font>

162
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:40,338
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nothing... yet.</font>

163
00:15:40,737 --> 00:15:41,796
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see...</font>

164
00:15:43,235 --> 00:15:45,862
<font color="#FFFFFF">He should be coming back soon, though...</font>

165
00:15:50,428 --> 00:15:53,455
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hello, Izumo, Kotetsu.</font>

166
00:15:53,824 --> 00:15:55,183
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, look who's here...</font>

167
00:15:56,122 --> 00:15:57,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why don't you head on into town?</font>

168
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:59,848
<font color="#FFFFFF">You'll see something interesting.</font>

169
00:16:00,248 --> 00:16:01,676
<font color="#FFFFFF">Something interesting...?</font>

170
00:16:03,814 --> 00:16:04,943
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell me!</font>

171
00:16:11,936 --> 00:16:13,635
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's having a ball...</font>

172
00:16:16,532 --> 00:16:21,397
<font color="#FFFFFF">This takes me back!
The village hasn't changed a bit!</font>

173
00:16:22,026 --> 00:16:28,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everyone! Naruto Uzumaki's back!</font>

174
00:16:31,547 --> 00:16:34,883
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's all so nostalgic...!</font>

175
00:16:35,213 --> 00:16:36,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yup! Yup!</font>

176
00:16:39,838 --> 00:16:42,576
<font color="#FFFFFF">They added GrandmaTsunade's
Mountainside Image!</font>

177
00:16:47,900 --> 00:16:49,099
<font color="#FFFFFF">For real...?</font>

178
00:16:49,469 --> 00:16:50,468
<font color="#FFFFFF">For real!</font>

179
00:16:52,096 --> 00:16:55,123
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto? Is that you, Naruto?</font>

180
00:16:57,261 --> 00:16:59,589
<font color="#FFFFFF">When did you get back, Naruto?</font>

181
00:17:00,218 --> 00:17:02,016
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just now!</font>

182
00:17:04,284 --> 00:17:06,781
<font color="#FFFFFF">Long time no see, Sakura!</font>

183
00:17:13,105 --> 00:17:16,302
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've gotten taller than me,
haven't you?</font>

184
00:17:16,502 --> 00:17:17,301
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh...?</font>

185
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,698
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! You're right.</font>

186
00:17:20,937 --> 00:17:24,893
<font color="#FFFFFF">He kind of... got
a build since I saw him last...</font>

187
00:17:26,232 --> 00:17:30,088
<font color="#FFFFFF">So? You think I've become
a bit womanly?</font>

188
00:17:30,358 --> 00:17:33,425
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're fine!
You haven't changed a bit.</font>

189
00:17:37,051 --> 00:17:41,846
<font color="#FFFFFF">You just don't understand
the heart of a woman...</font>

190
00:17:41,916 --> 00:17:43,245
<font color="#FFFFFF">Brother Naruto!</font>

191
00:17:47,740 --> 00:17:49,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sexy Jutsu!</font>

192
00:17:49,309 --> 00:17:50,468
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ohh!</font>

193
00:17:50,667 --> 00:17:51,806
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wha—?</font>

194
00:17:53,734 --> 00:17:57,331
<font color="#FFFFFF">How about that?
Pretty nice waist, hips and bust, huh?</font>

195
00:18:01,696 --> 00:18:05,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">Konohamaru...
I'm not a kid anymore.</font>

196
00:18:06,591 --> 00:18:10,388
<font color="#FFFFFF">And you too, shouldn't be using Jutsu...
like that...</font>

197
00:18:14,913 --> 00:18:19,239
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right. It isn't just
your appearance that's matured...</font>

198
00:18:20,677 --> 00:18:23,435
<font color="#FFFFFF">I kind of feel a bit lonesome,</font>

199
00:18:23,475 --> 00:18:25,932
<font color="#FFFFFF">but you've turned out quite admirable,
haven't you, Naruto?</font>

200
00:18:26,372 --> 00:18:30,997
<font color="#FFFFFF">Knowing you, I bet you came back
having acquired some incredible Jutsu.</font>

201
00:18:31,796 --> 00:18:34,494
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's such a boring Jutsu!</font>

202
00:18:34,523 --> 00:18:39,019
<font color="#FFFFFF">Check out my freshly
developed New Pervy Ninjutsu!</font>

203
00:18:39,089 --> 00:18:41,487
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right... Like the New Pervy Ninjutsu...</font>

204
00:18:41,516 --> 00:18:43,155
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here we go!</font>

205
00:18:46,382 --> 00:18:48,310
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, you idiot!</font>

206
00:19:00,098 --> 00:19:02,965
<font color="#FFFFFF">You haven't changed at all,
have you, you jerk?</font>

207
00:19:02,995 --> 00:19:05,093
<font color="#FFFFFF">After seeing each other for
the first time in like two years!</font>

208
00:19:05,133 --> 00:19:07,431
<font color="#FFFFFF">You make me do this
in barely two minutes!</font>

209
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:09,558
<font color="#FFFFFF">What am I supposed to do</font>

210
00:19:09,588 --> 00:19:11,486
<font color="#FFFFFF">with the feelings of admiration
I had for you earlier, huh?</font>

211
00:19:11,626 --> 00:19:14,354
<font color="#FFFFFF">- That short temper and incredible strength.
- I'm not the least bit lonesome!</font>

212
00:19:14,523 --> 00:19:16,981
<font color="#FFFFFF">- She's a second-generation Tsunade.
- Huh? God, I'm mad at myself!</font>

213
00:19:17,451 --> 00:19:20,348
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just like I thought,
Sakura hasn't changed at all...</font>

214
00:19:20,378 --> 00:19:23,474
<font color="#FFFFFF">In fact, I get the feeling she's
even more vicious than before...</font>

215
00:19:23,774 --> 00:19:25,572
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? Did you say something?</font>

216
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been a long time, you two.</font>

217
00:19:30,837 --> 00:19:33,035
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm sure your training produced
good results, right?</font>

218
00:19:33,464 --> 00:19:36,901
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you think we came back
without making progress?</font>

219
00:19:37,061 --> 00:19:38,799
<font color="#FFFFFF">It went perfectly!</font>

220
00:19:39,129 --> 00:19:42,396
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then show me those
results immediately.</font>

221
00:19:42,625 --> 00:19:43,794
<font color="#FFFFFF">Show you...?</font>

222
00:19:44,354 --> 00:19:46,052
<font color="#FFFFFF">You will take on a particular man.</font>

223
00:19:46,551 --> 00:19:49,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">I didn't send him on any missions
for the past several days</font>

224
00:19:49,488 --> 00:19:51,117
<font color="#FFFFFF">and had him standby
for this very purpose.</font>

225
00:19:52,645 --> 00:19:54,214
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your opponent will be...</font>

226
00:19:56,511 --> 00:19:57,411
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come in!</font>

227
00:20:02,376 --> 00:20:03,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh!</font>

228
00:21:35,782 --> 00:21:37,710
<font color="#FFFFFF">Today at around five
in the afternoon,</font>

229
00:21:37,740 --> 00:21:39,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">Security Ninja were found collapsed</font>

230
00:21:39,938 --> 00:21:42,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">at the fortress of
the Village Hidden in the Sand.</font>

231
00:21:42,306 --> 00:21:45,902
<font color="#FFFFFF">No signs of dispute were found
within the scene of the crime;</font>

232
00:21:45,932 --> 00:21:48,170
<font color="#FFFFFF">leading officials to believe
the crime might have been committed</font>

233
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:50,727
<font color="#FFFFFF">by someone in the village,
or a skilled intruder.</font>

234
00:21:50,927 --> 00:21:53,694
<font color="#FFFFFF">Around the same time,
there have been reported sightings</font>

235
00:21:53,724 --> 00:21:57,221
<font color="#FFFFFF">of two men dressed in black clothing
with red cloud patterns.</font>

236
00:21:57,261 --> 00:21:59,758
<font color="#FFFFFF">They are likely connected
to the incident.</font>

237
00:22:00,188 --> 00:22:02,755
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time:
"The Akatsuki Makes Its Move"</font>

